# Dawn (battlefield.dawn, Empyreal Paradox): helpers. Main (8-4 Status 1) registers area 1 and invites bob (8-4 at
# Status 4), cat (The Last Verse current: 8-4 completed) and dan (When Angels Fall current). bob and cat get the menu
# and enter; dan gets a lone release (no menu). Promathia killed: 32004 (1) to the three; main's finish spawns the
# second form; bob's and cat's find it spawned (only their move). It killed: 32001 to the three (bob and cat with
# the skip flag 1); 8-4's own 32001 finish moves only main's Status (1 to 2).
